      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "The extraction is mostly correct. Names, ages, birthplaces, occupations, and residence were extracted accurately, and the source was appropriately classified as derivative. However, the evaluation identifies the inferred Thomas–Mary and Patrick–parent relationships as the significant issue affecting correctness. Silas Kerrigan was handled correctly as a FAN lead without asserting a cross-surname relationship."
    },
