      "test_id": "ut_record_extraction_022",
      "dimension_source": "base",
      "dimension_name": "Correctness",
      "llm_score": 1,
      "corrected_score": 1,
      "comment": "he major error was failing to create the required inferred relationship assertions. The test explicitly required the relationships within the household—John Sr. and Barbara as an inferred couple and the younger household members as inferred children—to be persisted. The skill incorrectly treated the lack of a relationship column as a reason not to create these assertions."
    },
